.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt MASTER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm master
.Nd start the MASTER interactive runtime or submit an instruction
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar instruction ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
starts the Ruby runtime through
.Pa MASTER/bin/master .
With no instruction, it opens an interactive session.
With an instruction,
it submits that instruction to the same runtime.
.Pp
Every requested effect is governed by the current constitutional and policy
checks before execution.
A model proposal is not proof that an effect ran.
A file change is not complete until the required verification reports its
actual outcome.
.Pp
The repository's
.Pa MASTER/README.md
is the human entry point.
The implementation and its tests remain authoritative
for runtime behavior.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
MASTER/bin/master
MASTER/bin/master "Explain this repository"
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr master-fix 1 ,
.Xr operator 1
